# 💬 30 COPY-PASTE CLIENT COMMUNICATION SCRIPTS

ORGANIZED BY CATEGORY:
1. 💰 Payment (5 scripts)
2. 🔄 Scope Creep (6 scripts)
3. ⏰ Delays & Materials (5 scripts)
4. 👍 Approvals & Confirmations (4 scripts)
5. 🧱 Boundaries & Difficult Situations (5 scripts)
6. 🏁 Closing & Handover (5 scripts)

===================================================================

SCRIPT 1: Polite Upfront Deposit Request
"Hi [Name], I'm excited to get started on [Project]! To secure the timeline and officially book your kickoff slot, please find the invoice for the 50% deposit attached. Once cleared, we'll begin phase 1 immediately."

SCRIPT 2: Gentle Payment Overdue Follow-up
"Hi [Name], following up on invoice #[Number] sent on [Date]. Just wanted to check if you need any additional billing info from my end to process it?"

SCRIPT 3: Work Paused Due to Payment Delay
"Hi [Name], per our project agreement, active development pauses when milestones are overdue by 3 days. We're ready to jump straight into the next phase as soon as the invoice clears."

SCRIPT 4: Scope Creep Deflection ("I'd love to help")
"That sounds like a great addition to the platform! Since it's outside our agreed Statement of Work, I can prepare a brief Change Request with estimated hours and cost, or we can queue it for Phase 2 post-launch. Which do you prefer?"

SCRIPT 5: Client Delay Impacting Delivery Date
"Hi [Name], just a quick heads up: to hit our original target launch date of [Date], we'll need the finalized copy by [Day]. If delayed past then, our launch date will adjust day-for-day accordingly."

SCRIPT 6: Final Payment Before Live Handover
"The staging demo has been completed and verified! To transfer master DNS settings and admin credentials, please settle the final milestone invoice attached. Once confirmed, we'll go live right away."

